<Base title="Image Credits and Takedown" description="Where the images on YaY NYC come from, their licences, and how to ask for one to be removed.">
  <h1>Image credits and takedown</h1>
  <p>Every photo on YaY NYC is either ours, given to us by the venue, licensed from a stock library, or published under a free licence (such as Creative Commons) that allows this use, with its author and licence credited next to it. Maps use OpenStreetMap data.</p>
  <p>If you own an image on this site and believe it is used wrongly, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> with the page and the image. We remove it within 24 hours while we look into it.</p>
</Base>
